ading-companion-references-item"><p class="c-article-references__text" id="ref-CR72">Young IM (2003) The logic of masculinist protection: Reflections on the current security state. Signs: J Women Cult Soc 29:1–25. <a href="https://doi.org/10.1086/375708" data-track="click_references" data-track-action="external reference" data-track-value="external reference" data-track-label="10.1086/375708">https://doi.org/10.1086/375708</a></p><p class="c-article-references__links u-hide-print"><a data-track="click_references" rel="nofollow noopener" data-track-label="10.1086/375708" data-track-item_id="10.1086/375708" data-track-value="article reference" data-track-action="article reference" href="https://doi.org/10.1086%2F375708" aria-label="Article reference 72" data-doi="10.1086/375708">Article</a> 
